WEBVTT

00:25:58.625 --> 00:26:01.351
We can make the right choice

00:26:01.375 --> 00:26:05.292
to ultimately build the beloved community.

00:26:07.125 --> 00:26:08.375
Thank you.

00:26:12.417 --> 00:26:14.893
WPR: Thank you, Dr. King.

00:26:14.917 --> 00:26:16.893
Anthony Romero is the executive director

00:26:16.917 --> 00:26:18.726
of American Civil Liberties Union.

00:26:18.750 --> 00:26:21.768
As one of the nation's
oldest social justice organizations,

00:26:21.792 --> 00:26:23.893
the ACLU has advocated for racial equality

00:26:23.917 --> 00:26:26.101
and shown deep support
to the black community

00:26:26.125 --> 00:26:27.684
in moments of crisis.

00:26:27.708 --> 00:26:29.059
And in moments like these,

00:26:29.083 --> 00:26:31.351
black voices are almost always the loudest